1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
잘했는데 아무도 몰라준 날 있나요?
Haven't there been days you did well and nobody said a word?

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,626
윌리엄 제임스는 말했어요.
William James wrote,

3
00:00:06,726 --> 00:00:13,174
인정받고 싶은 건 인간의 가장 깊은 갈망이라고.
"The deepest principle in Human Nature is the craving to be appreciated."

4
00:00:13,274 --> 00:00:17,707
밤새 한 일이 조용히 지나간 날.
A day when the work you prepared all night passed in silence.

5
00:00:17,807 --> 00:00:23,500
말해 주는 이가 없어도 잘한 일은 남아요.
Good work doesn't disappear just because no one said it.

6
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,000
박수는 늦어도 돼요. 오늘은 제가 먼저요.
A late round of applause is fine.
For today, I'll clap first.
